RELEASE HISTORY

1.2.1 06/12/2016
! Missing index in temporary consent_record table

1.2.0 01/11/2016 
+ Added new options to extract research consented patients, remove memo/sensitive data, include ILH identifier, use field names only, separate checkbox values and only output field values
! Empty fields specified in component settings not being hidden

1.1.1 15/02/2015
! Exported data fields may be numbered incorrectly when repeated

1.1.0 13/01/2015
+ Support for section/domain records 

1.0.5 27/07/2015
! Problem creating titles with pages with no parent page 

1.0.4 17/06/2015
+ Integrated into composer-based install

1.0.3 16/02/2015
* Renamed Content_Text to Content_CSV (the former is used by the report_ext module)

1.0.2 26/07/2014
* Combined select and export into a single component
+ Form_Simple now used to generate page
+ ExportData component can now be used to build module specific export pages with parameters set in the page settings
+ Title and breadcrumb added to ExportData

1.0.1 17/07/2014
+ Access control to prevent access to exports
+ Edit export row function to edit encounters directly to correct errors
+ Range of dates (hard-coded currently)
+ Comma separated encounter types possible
+ Patient per line option to output all encounters on a single line (experimental)
- Removed implementation of OptionMenuInterface and replaced with the UserMenuOption component and settings

1.0.0 09/06/2014
* Initial version
